/strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/e739577d0d8bfd1907d36bf19936a873.poster.avif?t=1737194221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/e739577d0d8bfd1907d36bf19936a873.webm?t=1737194221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/e739577d0d8bfd1907d36bf19936a873.mp4?t=1737194221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most thrilling and intense fights are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>70+</strong> challenges from different mysterious locations</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-&gt; GET READY TO SWEAT IN MORTAL CHALLENGES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/bf4ac3e709064893e646e8df7044b357.poster.avif?t=1737194221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/bf4ac3e709064893e646e8df7044b357.webm?t=1737194221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010140/extras/bf4ac3e709064893e646e8df7044b357.mp4?t=1737194221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Are you brave enough to challenge the <strong>HELL</strong>?</p>",
